 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The technique of argumentative counterpoint",
     "texto": [
      "To build a mature persuasive speech, the author must not ignore the counter-arguments but must incorporate them dialectically, acknowledging their partial relevance before reasserting the priority of their approach: **Zwar bringt die Digitalisierung erhebliche Umstellungen mit sich, allerdings überwiegen die Chancen für den Bildungssektor** (Admittedly digitalisation brings considerable changes; however, the opportunities for the education sector predominate)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Nuances of freilich and nichtsdestoweniger",
     "texto": [
      "Connecting adverbs such as **freilich** (certainly, of course) or **nichtsdestoweniger** (nonetheless, all the same) allow you to concede a point to the opponent without weakening your own position: **Kritiker warnen vor den Risiken; nichtsdestoweniger bleibt die Initiative zukunftsweisend** (critics warn of the risks; nevertheless the initiative remains forward-looking)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Structure",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Argumentative load",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Example",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
